            <ArticleTitle>[The surgical and drug treatment of ischemic heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>23-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Results are presented of surgical treatment of ischemic heart disease at the Kiev Research Institute of Cardiovascular Surgery in 1988-1989; 424 patients were operated on including 73 undergoing aneurysmectomy and valve prosthesis. The lethality was 6.1% improvement was observed in 96.7%; 78.3% were completely free of angina attacks. The tactics of medical and surgical treatment of ischemic heart disease are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
